[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331382236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122520#issuecomment-5331382236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122520","id":5331382236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPcZv3A","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T16:53:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T16:53:09Z","body":"Given the negative reactions to the PR and the proposal, along with the good points that Synzorasize made in the proposal thread, I think I'll close both for now.\r\n\r\nBig reasons against this PR:\r\n- It's already possible to create a keyboard shortcut to toggle scene-uniqueness for a node. As of my writing this, there doesn't seem to be a default keybind for it, and we could perhaps work on that, but that's an issue for a separate proposal/PR.\r\n- The current requirement of `%` being the first character in the new node name matches the format that users reference the node name in `get_node()` calls. To put it another way, you can't write something like `get_node(\"HealthB%ar\")` in a script and get the scene-unique node named `HealthBar`, so it makes less sense that you'd be able to set its name to `HealthB%ar` in the editor and make it scene-unique with the name `HealthBar`.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331382236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331567333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122520#issuecomment-5331567333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122520","id":5331567333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPclC5Q","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T17:11:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T17:11:04Z","body":"> there doesn't seem to be a default keybind for it, and we could perhaps work on that, but that's an issue for a separate proposal/PR.\r\n\r\nFeel free to bikeshed in #109124","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url"